{
  "title": "Nutty Tunisian Semolina Tagine",
  "description": "A creamy and umami Tunisian dish featuring semolina, perfect for festive occasions, and can be made dairy-free friendly, served in a scallop shell vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
